#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:131
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Exim"
msgstr "Instalação do Exim"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:134
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Before building <application>Exim</application>, as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user you should create the group and "
"user <systemitem class=\"username\">exim</systemitem> which will run the "
"<command>exim</command> daemon:"
msgstr ""
"Antes de construir o &quot;<application>Exim</application>&quot;, como o(a) "
"usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;, "
"você deveria criar o grupo e o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">exim</systemitem>&quot; os quais executarão o processo de"
" segundo plano &quot;<command>exim</command>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:140
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 31 exim &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -d /dev/null -c \"Exim Daemon\" -g exim -s /bin/false -u 31 exim</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 31 exim &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -d /dev/null -c \"Processo de Segundo Plano Exim\" -g exim -s /bin/false -u 31 exim</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:144
#, xml-text
msgid "Configure <application>Exim</application> with the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Configure o &quot;<application>Exim</application>&quot; com os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:147
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's,^BIN_DIR.*$,BIN_DIRECTORY=/usr/sbin,'    \\\n"
"    -e 's,^CONF.*$,CONFIGURE_FILE=/etc/exim.conf,' \\\n"
"    -e 's,^EXIM_USER.*$,EXIM_USER=exim,'           \\\n"
"    -e '/# USE_OPENSSL/s,^#,,' src/EDITME > Local/Makefile &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"printf \"USE_GDBM = yes\\nDBMLIB = -lgdbm\\n\" >> Local/Makefile\n"
"</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e 's,^BIN_DIR.*$,BIN_DIRECTORY=/usr/sbin,'    \\\n"
"    -e 's,^CONF.*$,CONFIGURE_FILE=/etc/exim.conf,' \\\n"
"    -e 's,^EXIM_USER.*$,EXIM_USER=exim,'           \\\n"
"    -e '/# USE_OPENSSL/s,^#,,' src/EDITME > Local/Makefile &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"printf \"USE_GDBM = yes\\nDBMLIB = -lgdbm\\n\" >> Local/Makefile\n"
"</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:156
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you want to add <application>Linux PAM</application> support, also run "
"the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Se você quiser adicionar suporte ao &quot;<application>Linux "
"PAM</application>&quot;, [então] execute também os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:159
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i '/# SUPPORT_PAM=yes/s,^#,,' Local/Makefile\n"
"echo \"EXTRALIBS=-lpam\" >> Local/Makefile\n"
"</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i '/# SUPPORT_PAM=yes/s,^#,,' Local/Makefile\n"
"echo \"EXTRALIBS=-lpam\" >> Local/Makefile\n"
"</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid "Build <application>Exim</application> with the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Construa o &quot;<application>Exim</application>&quot; com o seguinte "
"comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:167
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:171
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:175
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#.  dev note: make INSTALL_ARG=-no_chown DESTDIR=<DESTDIR>
#.  install
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:180
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install                                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/exim.8 /usr/share/man/man8 &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -vdm 755    /usr/share/doc/exim-&exim-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp      -Rv doc/*   /usr/share/doc/exim-&exim-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"ln -sfv exim /usr/sbin/sendmail                 &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -d -m750 -o exim -g exim /var/spool/exim</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install                                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/exim.8 /usr/share/man/man8 &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -vdm 755    /usr/share/doc/exim-&exim-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp      -Rv doc/*   /usr/share/doc/exim-&exim-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"ln -sfv exim /usr/sbin/sendmail                 &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -d -m750 -o exim -g exim /var/spool/exim</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:192
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:195
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>sed -e ... > Local/Makefile</command>: Most of "
"<application>Exim</application>'s configuration options are defined in "
"<filename>Local/Makefile</filename>, which is created from the "
"<filename>src/EDITME</filename> file. This command specifies the minimum set"
" of options. Descriptions for the options are listed below."
msgstr ""
"<command>sed -e ... > Local/Makefile</command>: A maioria das opções de "
"configuração do &quot;<application>Exim</application>&quot; é definida no "
"&quot;<filename>Local/Makefile</filename>&quot;, que é criado a partir do "
"arquivo &quot;<filename>src/EDITME</filename>&quot;. Esse comando especifica"
" o conjunto mínimo de opções. As descrições das opções estão listadas "
"abaixo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:203
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>printf ... > Local/Makefile</command>: Setting those variables "
"allows to use GDBM instead of the default Berkeley DB. Remove this command "
"if you have installed &berkeley-db;."
msgstr ""
"<command>printf ... > Local/Makefile</command>: Configurar essas variáveis "
"permite usar GDBM em vez do padrão Berkeley DB. Remova esse comando se você "
"tiver instalado &berkeley-db;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:209
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>BIN_DIRECTORY=/usr/sbin</parameter>: This installs all of "
"<application>Exim</application>'s binaries and scripts in <filename "
"class='directory'>/usr/sbin</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>BIN_DIRECTORY=/usr/sbin</parameter>: Isso instala todos os "
"binários e conjuntos de comandos sequenciais do "
"&quot;<application>Exim</application>&quot; em &quot;<filename "
"class='directory'>/usr/sbin</filename>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:215
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>CONFIGURE_FILE=/etc/exim.conf</parameter>: This installs "
"<application>Exim</application>'s main configuration file in <filename "
"class='directory'>/etc</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>CONFIGURE_FILE=/etc/exim.conf</parameter>: Isso instala o "
"principal arquivo de configuração do "
"&quot;<application>Exim</application>&quot; em &quot;<filename "
"class='directory'>/etc</filename>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:221
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>EXIM_USER=exim</parameter>: This tells "
"<application>Exim</application> that after the daemon no longer needs "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> privileges, the process "
"needs to hand off the daemon to the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">exim</systemitem> user."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>EXIM_USER=exim</parameter>: Isso informa ao "
"&quot;<application>Exim</application>&quot; que, depois que o processo de "
"segundo plano não mais precisar de privilégios de &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;, o processo precisa transferir o "
"processo de segundo plano para o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">exim</systemitem>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:237
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>USE_OPENSSL</parameter>: uncommenting "
"<option>USE_OPENSSL=yes</option> and <option>USE_OPNSSL_PC=yes</option> "
"tells the build system to use <application>OpenSSL</application>, and to "
"find the needed libraries with <application>pkg-config</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>USE_OPENSSL</parameter>: descomentar "
"<option>USE_OPENSSL=yes</option> e <option>USE_OPNSSL_PC=yes</option> "
"informa ao sistema de construção para usar "
"<application>OpenSSL</application> e encontrar o bibliotecas necessárias com"
" <application>pkg-config</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:245
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Uncomment <option>EXIM_MONITOR</option>: This allows building the "
"<application>Exim</application> monitor program, which requires "
"<application>X Window System</application> support, and is commented out by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Descomentar <option>EXIM_MONITOR</option>: Isso permite construir o "
"aplicativo monitor do <application>Exim</application>, o qual exige suporte "
"<application>X Window System</application> e é comentado por padrão."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:252
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>ln -sfv exim /usr/sbin/sendmail</command>: Creates a link to "
"<command>sendmail</command> for applications which need it.  "
"<application>Exim</application> will accept most "
"<application>Sendmail</application> command-line options."
msgstr ""
"<command>ln -sfv exim /usr/sbin/sendmail</command>: Cria um link para "
"&quot;<command>sendmail</command>&quot; para aplicativos que precisam dele. "
"O &quot;<application>Exim</application>&quot; aceitará a maioria das opções "
"de linha de comando do &quot;<application>Sendmail</application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:259
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>install -v -m750 -o exim -g exim /var/spool/exim</command>: Since "
"/var/spool is owned by root and this version of <command>exim</command> "
"drops <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> privileges early, to "
"run as user <systemitem class=\"username\">exim</systemitem>, it cannot "
"create the <filename class=\"directory\">/var/spool/exim</filename> "
"directory. As a work around, it is created manually."
msgstr ""
"<command>install -v -m750 -o exim -g exim /var/spool/exim</command>: Como "
"&quot;/var/spool&quot; é propriedade do &quot;root&quot; e essa versão do "
"&quot;<command>exim</command>&quot; elimina os privilégios de "
"&quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot; "
"antecipadamente, para executar como usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">exim</systemitem>&quot;, ele não consegue criar o "
"diretório &quot;<filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/spool/exim</filename>&quot;. Como solução "
"alternativa, ele é criado manualmente."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:271
#, xml-text
msgid "Adding Additional Functionality"
msgstr "Adicionando Funcionalidade Adicional"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:274
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To utilize some or all of the dependency packages, you'll need to modify "
"<filename>Local/Makefile</filename> to include the appropriate directives "
"and parameters to link additional libraries before you build "
"<application>Exim</application>. <filename>Local/Makefile</filename> is "
"heavily commented with instructions on how to do this. Listed below is "
"additional information to help you link these dependency packages or add "
"additional functionality."
msgstr ""
"Para utilizar alguns ou todos os pacotes de dependências, você precisará "
"modificar &quot;<filename>Local/Makefile</filename>&quot; para incluir as "
"diretivas e parâmetros apropriadas para vincular bibliotecas adicionais "
"antes de construir o &quot;<application>Exim</application>&quot;. O "
"&quot;<filename>Local/Makefile</filename>&quot; é bastante comentado com "
"instruções relativas a como fazer isso. Listadas abaixo estão informações "
"adicionais para te ajudar a vincular esses pacotes de dependências ou "
"adicionar funcionalidades adicionais."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:284
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you wish to build and install the <filename "
"class='extension'>.info</filename> documentation, refer to <ulink url= "
"\"https://exim.org/exim-html-&exim-"
"version;/doc/html/spec_html/ch04.html#SECTinsinfdoc\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Se você deseja construir e instalar a documentação &quot;<filename "
"class='extension'>.info</filename>&quot;, [então] consulte <ulink url= "
"\"https://exim.org/exim-html-&exim-version;/doc/ "
"html/spec_html/ch04.html#SECTinsinfdoc\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:291
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you wish to build in Exim's interfaces for calling virus and spam "
"scanning software directly from access control lists, uncomment the "
"<option>WITH_CONTENT_SCAN=yes</option> parameter and review the information "
"found at <ulink url= \"https://exim.org/exim-html-&exim-"
"version;/doc/html/spec_html/ch45.html\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Se você deseja construir interfaces do &quot;Exim&quot; para chamar "
"logiciário de verificação de vírus e de &quot;spam&quot; diretamente a "
"partir de listas de controle de acesso, [então] descomente o parâmetro "
"&quot;<option>WITH_CONTENT_SCAN=yes</option>&quot; e revise as informações "
"encontradas em <ulink url=\"https://exim .org/exim-html-&exim-"
"version;/doc/html/spec_html/ch45.html\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:299
#, xml-text
msgid ""
