#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:360
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring Exim"
msgstr "Configurando o Exim"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:363
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:366
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<filename>/etc/exim.conf</filename> and <filename>/etc/aliases</filename>"
msgstr ""
"<filename>/etc/exim.conf</filename> e <filename>/etc/aliases</filename>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:371
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/exim.conf"
msgstr "/etc/exim.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:375
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/aliases"
msgstr "/etc/aliases"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:381
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:384
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Review the file <filename>/etc/exim.conf</filename>, and modify any settings"
" to suit your needs. Note that the default configuration assumes that the "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/var/mail</filename> directory is world "
"writable, but has the sticky bit set. If you want to use the default "
"configuration, issue as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>"
" user:"
msgstr ""
"Revise o arquivo &quot;<filename>/etc/exim.conf</filename>&quot; e modifique"
" quaisquer configurações para atender às suas necessidades. Observe que a "
"configuração padrão assume que o diretório &quot;<filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/mail</filename>&quot; é escrevível mundialmente, "
"mas tem o bit &quot;sticky&quot; configurado. Se você quiser usar a "
"configuração padrão, [então] emita como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:392
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>chmod -v a+wt /var/mail</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>chmod -v a+wt /var/mail</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:395
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"A default (nothing but comments) <filename>/etc/aliases</filename> file is "
"installed during the package installation if this file did not exist on your"
" system. Create the necessary aliases and start the "
"<application>Exim</application> daemon using the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Um arquivo &quot;<filename>/etc/aliases</filename>&quot; padrão (nada além "
"de comentários) é instalado durante a instalação do pacote se esse arquivo "
"não existir em seu sistema. Crie os apelidos necessários e inicie o processo"
" de segundo plano &quot;<application>Exim</application>&quot; usando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:401
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/aliases &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>postmaster: root\n"
"MAILER-DAEMON: root</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"/usr/sbin/exim -bd -q15m</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/aliases &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>postmaster: root\n"
"MAILER-DAEMON: root</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"/usr/sbin/exim -bd -q15m</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:409
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To protect an existing <filename>/etc/aliases</filename> file, the command "
"above appends these aliases to it. This file should be checked and duplicate"
" aliases removed, if present."
msgstr ""
"Para proteger um arquivo &quot;<filename>/etc/aliases</filename>&quot; "
"existente, o comando acima anexa esses apelidos a ele. Esse arquivo deveria "
"ser verificado e os apelidos duplicados removidos, se presentes."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:416
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <command>/usr/sbin/exim -bd -q15m</command> command starts the "
"<application>Exim</application> daemon with a 15 minute interval in "
"processing the mail queue. Adjust this parameter to suit your desires."
msgstr ""
"O comando &quot;<command>/usr/sbin/exim -bd -q15m</command>&quot; inicia o "
"processo de segundo plano &quot;<application>Exim</application>&quot; com um"
" intervalo de quinze (15) minutos no processamento da fila de mensagens. "
"Ajuste esse parâmetro para atender aos teus desejos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:424
#, xml-text
msgid "Linux PAM Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Linux PAM"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:427
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have built <application>Exim</application> with <application>Linux "
"PAM</application> support, you need to create a "
"<application>PAM</application> configuration file to get it working "
"correctly with BLFS."
msgstr ""
"Se tiver construído o &quot;<application>Exim</application>&quot; com "
"suporte ao &quot;<application>Linux PAM</application>&quot;, [então] você "
"precisa criar um arquivo de configuração "
"&quot;<application>PAM</application>&quot; para fazê-lo funcionar "
"corretamente com o BLFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:434
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Issue the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user to create the configuration file "
"for <application>Linux PAM</application>:"
msgstr ""
"Emita o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> para criar o arquivo de configuração "
"para <application>Linux PAM</application>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:439
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/exim &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/pam.d/exim\n"
"\n"
"auth    include system-auth\n"
"account include system-account\n"
"session include system-session\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/pam.d/exim</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/exim &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Inicia /etc/pam.d/exim\n"
"\n"
"auth    include system-auth\n"
"account include system-account\n"
"session include system-session\n"
"\n"
"# Termina /etc/pam.d/exim</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:452
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\">Boot Script</phrase> <phrase "
"revision=\"systemd\">Systemd Unit</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\">Conjunto de Comandos Sequenciais de "
"Inicialização</phrase> <phrase revision=\"systemd\">Unidade do "
"systemd</phrase>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:456
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To automatically start <command>exim</command> at boot, install the <phrase "
"revision=\"sysv\"><filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/exim</filename> init "
"script</phrase> <phrase "
"revision=\"systemd\"><filename>exim.service</filename> unit</phrase> "
"included in the <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\" revision=\"sysv\"/> <xref "
"linkend=\"systemd-units\" revision=\"systemd\"/> package:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar automaticamente o &quot;<command>exim</command>&quot; na "
"inicialização, instale <phrase revision=\"sysv\">o conjunto de comandos "
"sequenciais de iniciação "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/exim</filename>&quot; incluso</phrase> "
"<phrase revision=\"systemd\">a unidade "
"&quot;<filename>exim.service</filename>&quot; inclusa</phrase> no pacote "
"&quot;<xref linkend=\"bootscripts\" revision=\"sysv\"/>&quot; &quot;<xref "
"linkend=\"systemd-units\" revision=\"systemd\"/>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:466 blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:538
#, xml-text
msgid "exim"
msgstr "exim"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:469
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install-exim</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-exim</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/exim.xml:472
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The bootscript also starts the <application>Exim</application> daemon and "
"dispatches a queue runner process every 15 minutes. Modify the "
"<option>-q<replaceable>&lt;time interval&gt;</replaceable></option> "
"parameter in <filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/exim</filename>, if necessary for "
"your installation."
msgstr ""
"O script de inicialização também inicia o processo de segundo plano "
"&quot;<application>Exim</application>&quot; e despacha um processo executor "
"de fila a cada quinze (15) minutos. Modifique o parâmetro "
"&quot;<option>-q<replaceable>&lt;time "
"interval&gt;</replaceable></option>&quot; em "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/exim</filename>&quot;, se necessário para a"
" tua instalação."

